0..54 Comment "// Two nominal rules can overlap below an abstraction."
55..57 Comment "//"
58..107 Comment "// A rule abstraction has one head at each depth."
108..110 Comment "//"
111..155 Comment "// The checker finds the pair at that depth."
156..190 Comment "// The kernel finds the same pair."
191..193 Comment "//"
194..209 Comment "// - see: #1709"
211..283 Comment "/// `inner` rewrites the inner restriction to a normal form, and `outer`"
284..362 Comment "/// rewrites the whole term to `z()`. Completion derives a rule that joins the"
363..379 Comment "/// two reducts."
